earer *and* lower mass, so no tradeoff was needed here.\n- **Rule 4**: Fewer branches/statements for the same semantics.\n\n---\n\n**Refactoring Complete**\n\n**Refactoring**: Consolidated duplicated if/else-if branches (Rule 3: No Duplication) into a single explaining variable `willBeAlive` (Rule 2: Reveals Intent) expressing the Game of Life survival/birth rule as one boolean condition.\n\n**Mass Change**: 24 → 19 (delta -5)\n\n**Tests**: All 10 tests passing (confirmed via `NODE_ENV=development pnpm test` before and after the change)."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-sonnet-5@eu","usage":{"input":4562,"output":1807,"cacheRead":10805,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":17174,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784961413720,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-ca5045e2-6f19-4444-9e52-3d47f1367daf","responseModel":"claude-sonnet-5"}],"stderr":"","usage":{"input":52774,"output":10423,"cacheRead":43220,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":0,"contextTokens":17174,"turns":7},"model":"requesty/vertex/claude-sonnet-5@eu","stopReason":"stop"}]}}}
